		(property "Description" "Ebyte E28-2G4M27SX: SX1280 + PA + LNA + antenna switch, +27 dBm, 2.4 GHz, 16 castellated pads at 1.27 mm, 15 x 20 mm. Antenna is an ON-MODULE IPEX, so the board carries no RF network for this radio. Pin map from tracker/hardware/footprints/e28/E28-2G4M27SX.md (datasheet ch.3); pads 8/9 UNASSIGNED (OPEN-E28-EN)."
