				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "Per-wing nichrome cutter channel (ADR-051 s2.5 item 5 + s2.6), restored to v10 by ADR-129 D5. pin 1 = /VSCAP (raw supercap node, post-BAT54, PRE-LDO, so a cut works with the converter dead -- ADR-047 s2.1), pin 2 = GND, pin 3 = the wing's RF_FEED land (cut DRIVE and continuity SENSE on one conductor plus the shared ground). THE DRIVE MUST BE A LATCHED ONE-SHOT (ADR-051 s2.5.1). Exact part, sense divider and latch topology TODO(unverified) -- OPEN-31."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects
				(font
