		(uuid "7476595f-179b-551e-8dff-e1511466eba3")
	)	(text "SOURCE OF TRUTH (pins): tracker/hardware/connectivity/v10_pinmap.reg   sha256 04975e8ab1daade8   (58 net(s), 42 UNASSIGNED pin(s)).  hub_board_v10.kicad_pcb is a BUILD PRODUCT of that registry; the parity gate reads it back to CHECK, never to author."
