		(uuid "15a090ce-b002-5ae2-8914-552be58df0c8")
	)	(text "PARTS (ADR-118/119/121/123): U1 ESP32-S3-WROOM-1U-N8R8; U2 LoRa2021F33-2G4 = 433 MHz TX (site A); U3 bare LoRa2021 = 2.4 GHz RX (site B); U_C bare LoRa2021 (site C); U_E28 E28-2G4M27SX = 2.4 GHz ranging (site D); U5 MAX-M10S GNSS; U6 MS5611 baro; U7 TPS7A02 LDO; C_CAP1/C_CAP2 supercap bank; J_PROG prog+USB header; J_W1..J_W4 wing sockets; ANT1..ANT4 U.FL."
